                                                "sense_id": "25d46942-c068-3c60-8517-fd747b3d24c7",
                                                "text": "Then there were cockroach hunts; we chased them out of their haunts, where at night they busily devoured currants, jam, and sugar; in fact their diet was far more varied than ours, for they made plentiful meals off our boots, the coverings of our books, and any stray pieces of flannel that came in their way."
                                            }
